        - training is disabled (using ``.eval()``)
        - batch_first is ``True`` and the input is batched (i.e., ``src.dim() == 3``)
        - activation is one of: ``"relu"``, ``"gelu"``, ``torch.functional.relu``, or ``torch.functional.gelu``
